#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Qiskit Code of Conduct defines and enforces the values and conduct of "
"contributors and participants in the Qiskit open source community."
msgstr ""
"Kod Tatalaku Qiskit mentakrifkan dan menguatkuasakan nilai dan tatalaku "
"penyumbang dan peserta dalam komuniti sumber terbuka Qiskit."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Code of conduct"
msgstr "Kod tatalaku"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Code of conduct {#code-of-conduct}"
msgstr "Kod Tatalaku {#code-of-conduct}"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Our Pledge {#our-pledge}"
msgstr "Ikrar Kami {#our-pledge}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Qiskit Community is dedicated to our values of treating every individual\n"
"with respect and dignity. In the interest of fostering an open and welcoming\n"
"environment, all participants, including attendees, speakers, sponsors,\n"
"volunteers, online contributors, and IBM employees are expected to show\n"
"courtesy for each other and our community by creating a harassment-free\n"
"experience for everyone, regardless of age, personal appearance, disability,\n"
"ethnicity, gender identity and expression, body size, level of experience,\n"
"nationality, race, religion, caste, or sexual identity and orientation.\n"
"Expected behavior applies to both online and offline engagement within the\n"
"Qiskit Community.\n"
msgstr ""
"Komuniti Qiskit berdedikasi kepada nilai kami dalam melayan setiap individu\n"
"dengan hormat dan maruah. Dalam usaha memupuk persekitaran yang terbuka dan mesra,\n"
"semua peserta, termasuk hadirin, penceramah, penaja,\n"
"sukarelawan, penyumbang dalam talian, dan pekerja IBM dijangka menunjukkan\n"
"kesopanan terhadap satu sama lain dan komuniti kami dengan mewujudkan pengalaman\n"
"bebas gangguan untuk semua orang, tanpa mengira umur, penampilan peribadi, kecacatan,\n"
"etnik, identiti dan ekspresi jantina, saiz badan, tahap pengalaman,\n"
"kewarganegaraan, bangsa, agama, kasta, atau identiti dan orientasi seksual.\n"
"Tingkah laku yang dijangka terpakai kepada kedua-dua penglibatan dalam talian dan luar talian dalam\n"
"Komuniti Qiskit.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Scope {#scope}"
msgstr "Skop {#scope}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The purpose of this Code of Conduct is to define and enforce the values and\n"
"conduct of contributors and participants in the Qiskit open source community.\n"
"The Code of Conduct applies both within project spaces and in public spaces\n"
"when an individual is engaging with the Qiskit open source community. Examples\n"
"include attending a Qiskit event, contributing to online projects, commentary\n"
"on Slack, or representing a project or community, including using an official\n"
"project e-mail address, posting via an official social media account, or\n"
"acting as an appointed representative at an online or offline event.\n"
"Representation of a project may be further defined and clarified by project\n"
"maintainers.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tujuan Kod Tatalaku ini adalah untuk mentakrifkan dan menguatkuasakan nilai dan\n"
"tatalaku penyumbang dan peserta dalam komuniti sumber terbuka Qiskit.\n"
"Kod Tatalaku ini terpakai dalam ruang projek dan dalam ruang awam\n"
"apabila seseorang individu terlibat dengan komuniti sumber terbuka Qiskit. Contoh-contoh\n"
"termasuk menghadiri acara Qiskit, menyumbang kepada projek dalam talian, ulasan\n"
"di Slack, atau mewakili projek atau komuniti, termasuk menggunakan alamat\n"
"e-mel projek rasmi, menghantar melalui akaun media sosial rasmi, atau\n"
"bertindak sebagai wakil yang dilantik di acara dalam talian atau luar talian.\n"
"Perwakilan projek mungkin ditakrifkan dan diperjelaskan lebih lanjut oleh penyelenggara projek.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Our Standards {#our-standards}"
msgstr "Piawaian Kami {#our-standards}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Examples of behavior that contributes to creating a positive environment\n"
"include:\n"
msgstr ""
"Contoh tingkah laku yang menyumbang kepada penciptaan persekitaran yang positif\n"
"termasuk:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Using welcoming and inclusive language\n"
msgstr "Menggunakan bahasa yang mesra dan inklusif\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Being respectful of differing viewpoints, experiences, and cultures\n"
msgstr "Menghormati sudut pandangan, pengalaman, dan budaya yang berbeza\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Gracefully accepting constructive criticism\n"
msgstr "Menerima kritikan membina dengan baik\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Focusing on what is best for the community\n"
msgstr "Memberi tumpuan kepada apa yang terbaik untuk komuniti\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Showing empathy towards other community members\n"
msgstr "Menunjukkan empati terhadap ahli komuniti yang lain\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Being mindful of your surroundings and your fellow participants and listening\n"
"to others\n"
msgstr ""
"Peka terhadap persekitaran dan rakan peserta anda serta mendengar\n"
"orang lain\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Valuing the contributions of all participants\n"
msgstr "Menghargai sumbangan semua peserta\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Engaging in collaboration before conflict\n"
msgstr "Terlibat dalam kerjasama sebelum konflik\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Pointing out unintentionally racist, sexist, casteist, or biased comments and\n"
"jokes made by community members when they happen\n"
msgstr ""
"Menegur komen dan jenaka yang tidak sengaja bersifat perkauman, seksis, "
"berasaskan kasta, atau berprasangka yang dibuat oleh ahli komuniti apabila "
"ia berlaku\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Examples of unacceptable behavior by participants, even when presented as\n"
"\"ironic\" or \"joking,\" include:\n"
msgstr ""
"Contoh tingkah laku yang tidak boleh diterima oleh peserta, walaupun dibentangkan sebagai\n"
"\"ironi\" atau \"bergurau,\" termasuk:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The use of sexualized language or imagery and unwelcome physical contact,\n"
"sexual attention, or advances\n"
msgstr ""
"Penggunaan bahasa atau imej yang bersifat seksual dan sentuhan fizikal yang tidak diingini,\n"
"perhatian seksual, atau ajakan seksual\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Trolling, insulting/derogatory comments, and personal or political attacks\n"
msgstr ""
"Trolling, komen menghina/merendahkan, dan serangan peribadi atau politik\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Public or private harassment, including offensive or degrading language\n"
msgstr ""
"Gangguan awam atau peribadi, termasuk bahasa yang menyinggung atau "
"merendahkan\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Publishing others' private information, such as a physical or electronic\n"
"address, without explicit permission. This includes any sort of \"outing\" of\n"
"any aspect of someone's identity without their consent.\n"
msgstr ""
"Menerbitkan maklumat peribadi orang lain, seperti alamat fizikal atau elektronik,\n"
"tanpa kebenaran nyata. Ini termasuk sebarang bentuk \"pendedahan\"\n"
"mana-mana aspek identiti seseorang tanpa persetujuan mereka.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\"Doxxing,\" Publishing screenshots or quotes, especially from identity slack\n"
"channels, private chat, or public events, without all quoted users' explicit\n"
"consent.\n"
msgstr ""
"\"Doxxing,\" Menerbitkan tangkapan skrin atau petikan, terutamanya dari saluran slack identiti,\n"
"sembang peribadi, atau acara awam, tanpa persetujuan nyata semua pengguna yang dipetik.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Engaging in spamming activities, such as repeatedly sending unsolicited "
"messages, LLMs (Large Language Models) output, advertisements, or "
"promotional content to community members without previous IBM "
"authorization.\n"
msgstr ""
"Terlibat dalam aktiviti spam, seperti menghantar mesej yang tidak diminta "
"berulang kali, output LLM (Model Bahasa Besar), iklan, atau kandungan "
"promosi kepada ahli komuniti tanpa kebenaran IBM sebelumnya.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Other conduct which could reasonably be considered inappropriate in a\n"
"professional setting\n"
msgstr ""
"Tatalaku lain yang secara munasabah boleh dianggap tidak sesuai dalam\n"
"persekitaran profesional\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"responsibilities-enforcement\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"responsibilities-enforcement\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Responsibilities and enforcement {#responsibilities-and-enforcement}"
msgstr "Tanggungjawab dan penguatkuasaan {#responsibilities-and-enforcement}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The entire Qiskit community is responsible for upholding the terms of the Code\n"
"of Conduct in Qiskit Community events and spaces and reporting violations if\n"
"they see them. The internal Qiskit team at IBM is ultimately responsible for\n"
"clarifying the standards of acceptable behavior and enforcement, and is expected\n"
"to take appropriate and fair corrective action in response to any instances of\n"
"unacceptable behavior.\n"
msgstr ""
"Seluruh komuniti Qiskit bertanggungjawab untuk menjunjung syarat-syarat Kod\n"
"Tatalaku dalam acara dan ruang Komuniti Qiskit serta melaporkan pelanggaran jika\n"
"mereka melihatnya. Pasukan Qiskit dalaman di IBM akhirnya bertanggungjawab untuk\n"
"menjelaskan piawaian tingkah laku yang boleh diterima dan penguatkuasaan, dan dijangka\n"
"mengambil tindakan pembetulan yang sesuai dan adil sebagai tindak balas terhadap sebarang kejadian\n"
"tingkah laku yang tidak boleh diterima.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If a participant or contributor engages in negative or harmful behavior, IBM\n"
"will take any action they deem appropriate, including but not limited to\n"
"issuing warnings, expulsion from an event with no refund, deleting comments,\n"
"permanent banning from future events or online community, or calling local law\n"
"enforcement. IBM has the right and responsibility to remove, edit, or reject\n"
"comments, commits, code, wiki edits, issues, and other contributions that are\n"
"not aligned to this Code of Conduct, or to temporarily or permanently ban any\n"
"contributor or participant for other behaviors that they deem inappropriate,\n"
"threatening, offensive, or harmful.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika peserta atau penyumbang terlibat dalam tingkah laku negatif atau berbahaya, IBM\n"
"akan mengambil sebarang tindakan yang mereka anggap sesuai, termasuk tetapi tidak terhad kepada\n"
"mengeluarkan amaran, pengusiran dari acara tanpa bayaran balik, memadamkan komen,\n"
"larangan kekal dari acara atau komuniti dalam talian masa hadapan, atau menghubungi penguatkuasaan undang-undang tempatan. IBM mempunyai hak dan tanggungjawab untuk mengeluarkan, mengedit, atau menolak\n"
"komen, komit, kod, suntingan wiki, isu, dan sumbangan lain yang tidak selari dengan Kod Tatalaku ini, atau untuk melarang sementara atau kekal mana-mana\n"
"penyumbang atau peserta atas tingkah laku lain yang mereka anggap tidak sesuai,\n"
"mengancam, menyinggung, atau berbahaya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "If you see a Code of Conduct violation:\n"
msgstr "Jika anda melihat pelanggaran Kod Tatalaku:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you feel comfortable, let the person know that what they did is not\n"
"appropriate and ask them to stop and/or edit or delete their message(s) or\n"
"comment(s).\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika anda berasa selesa, beritahu orang tersebut bahawa apa yang mereka lakukan adalah tidak\n"
"sesuai dan minta mereka berhenti dan/atau mengedit atau memadamkan mesej atau\n"
"ulasan mereka.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If the person does not immediately stop the behavior or correct the issue,\n"
"or if you're uncomfortable speaking up, flag a moderator and, if appropriate,\n"
"fill out the anonymous\n"
"[Code of Conduct violation form](https://airtable.com/shrl5mEF4Eun1aIDm).\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika orang tersebut tidak segera menghentikan tingkah laku atau membetulkan masalah,\n"
"atau jika anda tidak selesa untuk bersuara, tandakan kepada moderator dan, jika sesuai,\n"
"isi borang\n"
"[pelanggaran Kod Tatalaku](https://airtable.com/shrl5mEF4Eun1aIDm) yang tanpa nama.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Qiskit Community will open an investigation upon receiving your form\n"
"entry. When reporting, please include any relevant details, links,\n"
"screenshots, context, or other information that may be used to better\n"
"understand and resolve the situation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Komuniti Qiskit akan membuka siasatan apabila menerima entri borang anda. Semasa membuat laporan, sertakan sebarang butiran, pautan,\n"
"tangkapan skrin, konteks, atau maklumat lain yang relevan yang boleh digunakan untuk lebih memahami dan menyelesaikan situasi.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If the code of conduct violation occurs at an event and requires immediate\n"
"response or contains a concern about an individual attending an upcoming\n"
"event, contact the event's on-call Code of Conduct point of contact listed\n"
"in the event specific code of conduct document. If you don't feel comfortable\n"
"speaking to the point of contact in person, fill out a Code of Conduct\n"
"violation form entry and include the details of the event so that the Code of\n"
"Conduct enforcement board can contact the event's on-call Code of Conduct\n"
"point of contact.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika pelanggaran kod tatalaku berlaku di acara dan memerlukan tindak balas "
"segera atau mengandungi kebimbangan tentang individu yang akan menghadiri "
"acara yang akan datang, hubungi orang hubungan Kod Tatalaku bertugas acara "
"tersebut yang disenaraikan dalam dokumen kod tatalaku khusus acara. Jika "
"anda tidak berasa selesa bercakap dengan orang hubungan secara peribadi, isi"
" entri borang pelanggaran Kod Tatalaku dan sertakan butiran acara supaya "
"lembaga penguatkuasaan Kod Tatalaku boleh menghubungi orang hubungan Kod "
"Tatalaku bertugas acara.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If an IBM employee witnesses a Code of Conduct violation at any time, such as\n"
"at events, in a Slack channel, or open source forums, it is their\n"
"responsibility to file a Code of Conduct violation report.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika pekerja IBM menyaksikan pelanggaran Kod Tatalaku pada bila-bila masa, seperti\n"
"di acara, dalam saluran Slack, atau forum sumber terbuka, adalah\n"
"tanggungjawab mereka untuk memfailkan laporan pelanggaran Kod Tatalaku.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This Code of Conduct does not supersede existing IBM corporate policies, such as\n"
"the IBM Business Conduct Guidelines and IBM Business Partner Code of Conduct.\n"
"IBM employees must follow the IBM Business Conduct Guidelines. IBM business\n"
"partners must follow the IBM Business Partner Code of Conduct. IBM employees\n"
"concerned with a fellow IBMer's behavior should follow IBM's own internal HR\n"
"reporting protocols, which include engaging the offending IBMer's manager and\n"
"involving IBM Concerns and Appeals. IBM employees concerned with an IBM\n"
"business partner's behavior should notify tellibm@us.ibm.com.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kod Tatalaku ini tidak mengatasi dasar korporat IBM yang sedia ada, seperti\n"
"Panduan Tatalaku Perniagaan IBM dan Kod Tatalaku Rakan Kongsi Perniagaan IBM.\n"
"Pekerja IBM mesti mengikuti Panduan Tatalaku Perniagaan IBM. Rakan kongsi perniagaan IBM mesti mengikuti Kod Tatalaku Rakan Kongsi Perniagaan IBM. Pekerja IBM yang bimbang dengan tingkah laku rakan IBMer harus mengikuti protokol pelaporan HR dalaman IBM sendiri, yang merangkumi melibatkan pengurus IBMer yang melanggar peraturan dan melibatkan IBM Concerns and Appeals. Pekerja IBM yang bimbang dengan tingkah laku rakan kongsi perniagaan IBM harus memberitahu tellibm@us.ibm.com.\n"
